<title>USA: Chevron says to pursue UK refinery merger.</title>
<headline>Chevron says to pursue UK refinery merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chevron Corp will continue with the merger of its UK refining assets with France's Elf Aquitaine, despite the pullout of Murphy Oil Corp, a Chevron spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;The plans may be delayed a few weeks, but we will push ahead,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>Murphy withdrew from the proposed merger of its UK refining and marketing interests unit Murco Petroleum Limited, with Elf Oil UK Ltd and Chevron's Gulf Oil Ltd.</p>
<p>((-- David Chance, New York Newsroom +1 212 859 1902))</p>
</text>
